    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk Israeli ku beer, ‹Deelor'eé' ar Sabaáto harmagahhaak asma deeloorí a layár alqado tla/ángw aníng nee kuungae, nee dír xwaylarhúng sleémeero, as kahhó' kuungá' kawa xua' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kudá' kuungá' nu hhohhoeemiís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' deelór Sabaáto harmagahhaak, asma deeloorí ka hhoohhoo' as kuungá'. Heé deeloorí gaa meetagaas gár kuwa hariím a gaasa. Nee heé gadiyeé gaa tleehh deeloorihe a baynitisa dirhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadiyeduhúng tleehhaak deelo lahhooe, ala bál faanqw a baalár Sabaáto ar hungu/uma ar taa paraátl as anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ. Heé aa gadiyuus baalaarír Sabaátoro gár kuwa hariím a gaasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe xoorór Israeli baalaarír Sabaáto ngi harmagahh nee ngi iialooes baraá xwaylar'ín sleémeero, asma a alqadór alhhe'eesoó koomaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaarí a layár warqawaaká tla/ángw aníng nee xoorór Israeliro, asma anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, doori nee yaamuwo ina tleéhh deelo lahhoó', ala bál faanqwe gadiyeé ana máw niri hungu/uús.› »",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
